    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></math> be the roots of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ax</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>.</mo></math> Then the equation whose roots are <math><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
