  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> be the sum and product of the roots of the required equation. Then,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />So, the required equation is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />i.e. <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
